"profile_occupancy_daylight" = "Occupancy sensing with daylight harvesting";
"profile_occupancy_daylight_desc" = "An occupancy mode automatically turns lights on to a defined lux level when you enter a room，turns off when you leave,making this type of mode the most convenient,since you never have to touch the lighting controls.";

"profile_vacancy_daylight" = "Vacancy sensing with daylight harvesting";
"profile_vacancy_daylight_desc" = "A vacancy mode also automatically turns lights off when you are leave a room,but you need to manually turn them on when you walk into a room,the light level will maintain to a defined lux level.Vacancy sensing maximizes the energy savings from the sensor because it's not always necessary to turn lights on when you walk into a room.";

"profile_occupancy" = "Occupancy sensing";
"profile_occupancy_desc" = "An occupancy mode automatically turns lights on to a defined lumen level when you enter a room，turns off when you leave,making this type of mode the most convenient,since you never have to touch the lighting controls.";

"profile_vacancy" = "Vacancy sensing";
"profile_vacancy_desc" = "A vacancy mode also automatically turns lights off when you are leave a room,but you need to manually turn them on when you walk into a room,the light level will maintain to a defined lumen level.Vacancy sensing maximizes the energy savings from the sensor because it's not always necessary to turn lights on when you walk into a room.";

"profile_daylight" = "Daylight harvesting (Closed loop)";
"profile_daylight_desc" = "Daylight harvesting is a lighting control strategy used to maintain the required light level in the work area and reduce energy use.Luminaires adjust their light level automatically in response to changes in daylight.";

"profile_manual_control" = "Manual control";
"profile_manual_control_desc" = "All luminaires are switched on and off manually with a wall switch or APP.There is no or disabled motion sensing and light sensing functions on the lighting device.";

