"guidance_message_1" = "Click the \"+\" button in the lower right corner of the Main interface to add a device.";
"guidance_message_2" = "Add a member from an empty group interface to add it directly to the group.";
"guidance_message_3" = "Add Device interface, adding to a group can quickly synchronize group parameters to the device";
"guidance_message_4" = "Add Device interface, you can choose to add the device to space or group.";
"guidance_message_5" = "Add Device interface, adding to space is faster than adding to group.";
"guidance_message_6" = "Add Device interface, after scanning the target device, you can stop scanning to speed up the operation.";
"guidance_message_7" = "Add Device interface, Scan will continue, move the location to search without clicking scan again.";
"guidance_message_8" = "Add Device interface, adjust near-far to filter unnecessary devices, so as to identify the device faster.";
"guidance_message_9" = "Add Device interface, \"identify\" is used to identify the target device.";
"guidance_message_10" = "Swiping left and right on the main interface can quickly switch the main menu.";
"guidance_message_11" = "Swiping down can quickly exit the interface.";
"guidance_message_12" = "Press and hold the \"All\" button for dimming all lights.";
"guidance_message_13" = "After adding, press the \"ALL\" button once for ON/OFF to confirm if added correctly.";
"guidance_message_14" = "Device names are incrementally named starting from ID001, eliminating the need to name them yourself.";
"guidance_message_15" = "Lighting devices added to the space only have basic functions.";
"guidance_message_16" = "Some devices show a \"REPAIR\" message when added because some models are not set up on the device.";
"guidance_message_17" = "Click to sort by signal strength for easier discovery of nearby devices.";
"guidance_message_18" = "Devices from different manufacturers may turn off when dimming below 0%.";
"guidance_message_19" = "The second icon in the Group edit icons can be expanded to A-Z, 1-16, for easy identification.";
"guidance_message_20" = "Devices that have been added to other groups cannot be added to the current group.";
"guidance_message_21" = "After setting Auto, clicking Auto will restore to the set values and functions.";
"guidance_message_22" = "An empty group can directly add devices that are not yet networked.";
"guidance_message_23" = "Switches corresponding to the group can be created within the group.";
"guidance_message_24" = "Different profiles will display different group pages.";
"guidance_message_25" = "\"Sensor-3\" in a group means there are three devices with sensing capabilities in the group.";
"guidance_message_26" = "Expand the group's \"sensor-0\" to view specific sensing details.";
"guidance_message_27" = "DMotion sensors will display all trigger details.";
"guidance_message_28" = "Light sensors only display calibrated device details to reduce communication congestion.";
"guidance_message_29" = "Switches for the group can be preset directly in the group's more options.";
"guidance_message_30" = "Virtual switches can be preset and bound on-site, reducing setup time.";
"guidance_message_31" = "Multiple virtual switches can be created.";
"guidance_message_32" = "A group can be controlled by multiple switches.";
"guidance_message_33" = "A switch can control multiple groups.";
"guidance_message_34" = "Settings on the Profile can be adjusted.";
"guidance_message_35" = "Set shorter T2/T4 times for quick checks of motion sensing capabilities.";
"guidance_message_36" = "When checking motion sensing alone, it is recommended to use the 'Occupancy Sensing Profile.'";
"guidance_message_37" = "\"Occupancy Sensing with Daylight Harvesting\" requires both motion and light sensing capabilities.";
"guidance_message_38" = "\"Vacancy Sensing with Daylight Harvesting\" requires both motion and light sensing capabilities.";
"guidance_message_39" = "\"Occupancy Sensing\" requires motion sensing capabilities.";
"guidance_message_40" = "\"Vacancy Sensing\" requires motion sensing capabilities.";
"guidance_message_41" = "\"Daylight Harvesting\" requires light sensing capabilities.";
"guidance_message_42" = "\"Manual Control\" only has manual dimming capabilities.";
"guidance_message_43" = "Scenes are composed of groups, each of which can be individually set.";
"guidance_message_44" = "Scenes can be created custom or from templates.";
"guidance_message_45" = "A template is a preset combination of multiple states, which can be assigned to the relevant groups.";
"guidance_message_46" = "There are 30 built-in scenes commonly used in different places.";
"guidance_message_47" = "Clicking restore in the scene template will restore to the default settings.";
"guidance_message_48" = "Icons and names of template scenes can be redefined.";
"guidance_message_49" = "Parameters of template scenes can be modified to better fit actual conditions.";
"guidance_message_50" = "A total of 16 template scene parameter points can be added.";
"guidance_message_51" = "If the device does not have a color temperature function, the scene's color temperature will not be executed.";
"guidance_message_52" = "Select parameters first, then assign them to groups.";
"guidance_message_53" = "Preview to confirm the effects before saving the scene.";
"guidance_message_54" = "Unnecessary schedules can be temporarily disabled.";
"guidance_message_55" = "App updates, iOS can set to automatically update to the latest version in the App Store.";

